  "source_span": "Let $r = a_2.$  Then the first few terms are\n\\begin{align*}\na_1 &= 1, \\\\\na_2 &= r, \\\\\na_3 &= \\frac{a_2^2}{a_1} = r^2, \\\\\na_4 &= 2a_3 - a_2 = 2r^2 - r = r(2r - 1), \\\\\na_5 &= \\frac{a_4^2}{a_3} = \\frac{r^2 (2r - 1)^2}{r^2} = (2r - 1)^2, \\\\\na_6 &= 2a_5 - a_4 = (2r - 1)^2 - r(2r - 1) = (2r - 1)(3r - 2), \\\\\na_7 &= \\frac{a_6^2}{a_5} = \\frac{(2r - 1)^2 (3r - 2)^2}{(2r - 1)^2} = (3r - 2)^2, \\\\\na_8 &= 2a_7 - a_6 = 2(3r - 2)^2 - (2r - 1)(3r - 2) = (3r - 2)(4r - 3), \\\\\na_9 &= \\frac{a_8^2}{a_7} = \\frac{(3r - 2)^2 (4r - 3)^2}{(3r - 2)^2} = (4r - 3)^2, \\\\\na_{10} &= 2a_9 - a_8 = 2(4r - 3)^2 - (3r - 2)(4r - 3) = (4r - 3)(5r - 4).",
